Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Original change's description:
> [maglev] Retain ArrayBuffers of constant TypedArrays
>
> Constant TypedArrays are already held strongly by whatever
> object they're constant in (PropertyCell, constant field),
> and if they're no longer constants, the code should be deopted.
>
> As an additional defense, "retain" the buffers in Maglev code.
>
> This adds a "Retain" mechanism to Maglev; previously it was
> only possible in Turbofan / Turboshaft. (It doesn't really retain,
> but it inserts the target object as a weak embedded object,
> so if the object dies, the code is deoptimized.)
>
